  Rules I decided myself:
  - Regions the spec did not place: Russia, Belarus, Ukraine, Moldova and the Caucasus (Armenia, Azerbaijan, Georgia) are Europe. Central Asia (Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan, Turkmenistan, Uzbekistan) is Asia-Pacific. Afghanistan is Middle East & Africa. Greenland, Bermuda and St Pierre and Miquelon are North America. Antarctica and the minor territories are Other.
